        <h2>Conclusion: Key Takeaways on How Aerosol Cans Work</h2>

        <p>An aerosol can operates through the controlled interaction of:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Stored propellant pressure</li>
            <li>Precision valve sealing and flow control</li>
            <li>Flash atomization in the actuator</li>
            <li>Engineered spray dynamics</li>
        </ul>

        <p>The system is entirely driven by thermodynamics and fluid mechanics&mdash;not mechanical pumping. Commercial
            aerosol success depends on correct engineering of all components as a single functional system rather than
            as individual parts.</p>

